"The equip menu's default-armament buttons TOGGLE membership in the default loadout by queuing the registered equip/unequip actions against the item entity (hands re-resolve server-side when the active stance uses defaults). Buttons that cannot be used render visibly disabled: an armament needing more free hand than the total provides (mirror of equip_item's grip rule), a relic beyond the 4-cap, a verb with no registered action. Disablement recomputes live as gear changes."